From 5470933deacfbccd1185fefe4eebcfa76fe91dc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:56:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 22/43] Android: honest GBA BIOS check with picker

The bundled open-source BIOS covers Game Boy Player but has no joybus
code, so XD link detection requires the official GBA BIOS. The
checklist now verifies the effective BIOS by hash and offers a picker
that writes MAIN_GBA_BIOS_PATH, instead of claiming link-readiness the
bundle cannot deliver.
---
 .../xdnetplay/ui/XDLauncherActivity.kt        | 46 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../features/xdnetplay/ui/XDLauncherScreen.kt | 15 +++++-
 2 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Source/Android/app/src/main/java/org/dolphinemu/dolphinemu/features/xdnetplay/ui/XDLauncherActivity.kt b/Source/Android/app/src/main/java/org/dolphinemu/dolphinemu/features/xdnetplay/ui/XDLauncherActivity.kt
